00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:09.630
Iyi videwo itanga intangiriro mugikoresho cya Arclight.

2
00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:15.207
Numara kwomeka kumwobo wuruhande rwa ophthalmoscope itaziguye izashyirwa muburyo butaziguye

3
00:00:15.207 --> 00:00:20.785
hejuru ya lens kamera yawe igendanwa ikoresha muri videwo

4
00:00:20.785 --> 00:00:26.362
uburyo.

5
00:00:26.362 --> 00:00:30.978
Kamera izakora nkamaso yawe.

6
00:00:30.978 --> 00:00:38.479
Iyo urimo kureba mu mwobo wo kuruhande, kugirango wemeze lens kuri

7
00:00:38.479 --> 00:00:45.980
gutondekanya umwobo kuruhande, fungura videwo kuri terefone yawe.

8
00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.460
Shira urutoki rwawe kuri buri lens.

9
00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:55.380
Iyo ecran yijimye, uba utwikiriye lens ikoreshwa kuri videwo.

10
00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:59.460
Kuraho impapuro z'umuhondo inyuma ya clip.

11
00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:06.700
Shira ingingo z'umwambi hejuru ya lens zikoreshwa mu gufata amashusho.

12
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:09.420
Kanda clip hasi ushikamye.

13
00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:11.320
Kuraho umwambi.

14
00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:14.780
Clip igomba noneho kuba mumwanya ukwiye.

15
00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:20.018
Gufata amashusho ya reflex kuri diregiteri wa Talmosco, iherezo ryigikorwa

16
00:01:20.018 --> 00:01:21.140
amatara hanyuma uhitemo

17
00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:24.300
urumuri rwinshi hamwe no gukanda gatatu.

18
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.500
Menya neza ko lens rack iri hejuru.

19
00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:33.020
Numucyo ureba kure ya terefone werekeza umurwayi, shyira urumuri rwibikorwa

20
00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:37.460
clip hanyuma ukurura elastike hejuru kugirango umutekano.

21
00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:42.220
Shyira kumurika ibikorwa kugeza bidashobora kunyerera ukundi.

22
00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:47.167
Umwobo wa slide yumuyobozi wa oscilloscope noneho uzaba urangiye neza

23
00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:48.580
Hagati ya

24
00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.020
lens ifata amashusho.

25
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:56.100
Kwandika ijisho ryo hanze, koresha urundi ruhande rwibikoresho.

26
00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:02.458
Gufata amashusho nonaha, fungura videwo hejuru hanyuma uhindure kuzuza ecran

27
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:03.820
hamwe na Reba

28
00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:05.660
unyuze mu mwobo.

29
00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.700
Kanda inyandiko hanyuma ukore ikizamini.

30
00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.740
Kanda ahagarike hanyuma ubike videwo.

31
00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:18.220
Urashobora noneho gusangira nabakozi mukorana kurubuga rwa SQR rwihishwa gusa kubwintego wungutse

32
00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:26.590
